## Conclusion

The delivery meets every item of the review standard and the objective: OpenML 61 from OpenML,
nested choice of k without leakage, 10 x stratified 5-fold paired design, mean accuracies and the
paired difference with dependence-corrected 95% intervals, claims matched to the intervals, the full
CV run once on Ibex (node cn504-20, job 53905964) and once locally with byte-identical outputs,
a two-page NeurIPS 2026 submission-template PDF compiled from the delivered LaTeX with one figure,
one table and the code that produced every number next to it. Independently reproduced end to end.
No open findings. Approved for release.
